{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269PwgacIlWD1794580515.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全球智能製造與電子產品博覽會下月在澳門和珠海同步舉辦，有逾千間企業參展。</p><p></p><p>主辦單位指，博覽會下月三日至五日，在澳門威尼斯人金光會展中心舉行，展出廣州、深圳、珠海及東莞等大灣區企業智能製造的創新產品，預計將吸引五萬名，海內外熟悉業務人士參與。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.M.PRODUCT-2030_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tw4GcJIfGk1794580522.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有研發「膠囊胃鏡」的廣州企業稱，期望透過參展，將產品推向國際市場。</p><p></p><p>廣州參展企業負責人陳海斌說：「我們是希望有一個『出海』過程，目前這展會是雙城一地模式，希望通過這展會，讓更多海外渠道、合作夥伴也可以提前了解體驗我們產品，以便有更深入的合作。」</p><p><br/></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.610189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:19.480961+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:16:47.387254+00:00","content_hash":"9abeb2dcc5f77d8a3234edfbad204228a2c384f2770600d954b33dea88360f04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}